Q: How to write an extension method for my Asp.net mvc application A: <pre><code>public static string KumarsExtension(this string input)
{
    return input.Replace("&gt;", "&gt; ").Replace("&lt;", "&lt; ");
}
</code></pre>

Q: How to style table with only vertical cell spacing? A: <p>Cleaner <code>&lt;table&gt;</code> element solution (useful for in-lining styles).</p>
<p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="false" data-babel="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-css lang-css prettyprint-override"><code>table {
  border-collapse: separate;
  border-spacing: 0 20px;
}

th {
  background-color: blue;
  color: white;
}

th, td {
  width: 150px;
  border: 1px solid black;
  padding: 5px;
}</code></pre>
<pre class="snippet-code-html lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;Vehicle     &lt;th&gt;No. of Wheels  &lt;th&gt;Rep (0-10)
    &lt;tr&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;Skateboard  &lt;td&gt;4              &lt;td&gt;7
    &lt;tr&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;BMX         &lt;td&gt;2              &lt;td&gt;6
    &lt;tr&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;Unicycle    &lt;td&gt;1              &lt;td&gt;-1</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</p>
